{"version":1,"content":"<p>許志安一連3場「許志安 Andy Hui〈On Stage〉Live in Concert 2026」於昨晚（10日）圓滿落幕。</p><p>太太鄭秀文（Sammi）一連3晚均現身紅館支持，並在開場前於後台為丈夫祈禱，給予大量鼓勵及心靈上的支持。</p><p>隨着最後一場順利結束，Sammi亦坦言終於能夠放鬆心情。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T12:57:54.479145+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T12:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T15:18:07.088018+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"4a66a7eb379e0880c06cd433ae5d063e2e9e0de9fad747aaf8b5a5ff04526e82","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}